<h1>Label Context Menu</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This menu appears when user right clicks with the mouse on <span lang="EN-US">a label in</span> <span class="Mode" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Edit label</u></span> <span lang="EN-US">mode only (</span><span class="Mode" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Inspection</u></span> <span lang="EN-US">mode)</span>. <span lang="EN-US">Most of the</span> commands are accessible also via the <span lang="EN-US"><a href="../Menus/Labels_Menu_Inspection.htm">Labels Menu</a>.</span> Th<span lang="EN-US">e context</span> menu contains the following group of commands:</p>
<table class="TableGrid" style="border:none; border-collapse:separate; left:0px; top:204px; width:716px; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="716">
<col class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="21.005%" class="whs6">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
<p class="whs7"><img src="../images/label_context_menu.gif" width="121px" height="149px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="78.995%" class="whs9">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-US">Label context menu is divided in 4 sections:</span></p>
<p class="normal-table"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Delete Label</b></span> <span lang="EN-US"> deletes the label pointed by the mouse.</span></p>
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Arrange labels section</b></span><span lang="EN-US">:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Command">Auto Arrange</span> <span lang="EN-US"> switches on the auto arrange mode for labels.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span class="Command">Arrange</span> <span lang="EN-US"> used for arranging labels when the auto update mode is not on.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Label settings section</b></span><span lang="EN-US">:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span class="Command">Colouring</span> <span lang="EN-US"> enable this mode to display labels background with the colour of the point (in this case text colour in labels is automatically adjusted according to the background - for optimal visualisation). If disabled all labels have black text on white background.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span class="Command">Format</span> <span lang="EN-US"> launches a dialog for information settings of the current label.</span> If <a href="../References/Format_Labels.htm" style="font-weight:normal;">Format Labels</a> command called from main menu it affects all labels, if called from Labels Context Menu it affects current label only.</p>
<p class="normal-table"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Delete All</b></span> <span lang="EN-US"> deletes all labels from the current page.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="Note" id="p3"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span> &#160;Modifying label properties from the context menu affects only the current label (but not those created in normal mode). If you wish to modify all inspection labels use the commands from <span lang="EN-US">Labels Menu</span> instead.</p>

